<title>UK: INSIGHT - Copper vulnerable after bearish close.</title>
<headline>INSIGHT - Copper vulnerable after bearish close.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>---------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> 3 MONTH     CLOSE  * SUPPORT * RESIST * RSI14 * MA10 * MA30</p>
<p> COPPER     2295/00 *  2290   *  2330  *  33   * 2397 * 2486</p>
<p> ALUMINIUM  1555/58  *  1545   *  1572  *  38   * 1599 * 1596</p>
<p>---------------VIEWS FROM THE MARKET - July 9-- ---------------</p>
<p>The copper price looked vulnerable on Wednesday after a weak close, with a drop to $2,210 a tonne possible if initial support failed to hold, analysts said.</p>
<p>A long-term retracement to even lower numbers was possible if the bearish tone took a hold, they said.</p>
